OL,3,ABBC News channel launches on YouTube
OL,4,Afor viewers in UK and US
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC News channel has been made
OL,7,Favailable to stream live on YouTube for
OL,8,Fviewers in the UK and USA.
OL,10,FThe trial, which began on Thursday, has
OL,11,Fbeen described by BBC bosses as "a
OL,12,Fsignificant step" in expanding access
OL,13,Fto "trusted, impartial journalism in
OL,14,Fmore places people use every day".
OL,16,FThe move is an expansion of what the
OL,17,FBBC has already done in other
OL,18,Fcountries, with the news channel also
OL,19,Favailable to YouTube viewers in
OL,20,FAustralia, Kenya, Nigeria, and Poland.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
